+<?php /** Plain-language scope of this sample theme. */ ?>
+<div class="wrap reading-width policy-copy section-space">
+	<h2>Demo inquiries</h2><p>The inquiry controls check sample fields in your browser and display a demonstration notice. They do not send an email, store an inquiry, take a payment, or reserve a workshop. Please do not enter personal or sensitive information.</p>
+	<h2>Images &amp; site assets</h2><p>The theme loads its photographs, styles, and scripts locally. It does not include remote fonts, analytics, advertising trackers, or third-party runtime scripts. Photographer credit links lead to Unsplash when selected.</p>
+	<h2>The website environment</h2><p>WordPress, the hosting provider, or separately installed plugins may process technical data, logs, cookies, or comments independently of this theme. The site operator must review those services and publish an accurate policy before using this design for a real business.</p>
+	<h2>Before a real studio opens</h2><p>The operator should provide verified contact details, explain collection and retention of personal information, and replace demonstration forms with a suitable service. This sample contains no active studio contact address.</p>
+	<a class="button" href="<?php echo clay_still_url(); ?>">Back to a slower everyday ↗</a>
+</div>
