+	<article class="offering"><span class="eyebrow">01 / Learn</span><div><h2>Introductory handbuilding</h2><p>Two and a half hours exploring pinching, joining, and shaping. Make a small vessel and discover the pleasure of working slowly. Clay, tools, guidance, and a sample firing plan are included in the imagined format.</p><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo clay_still_url( '/services/featured/' ); ?>">Explore the workshop ↗</a></div><span class="offering-note">A gentle beginning</span></article>
