+# Clay & Still changelog
+
+## 1.0.0
+
+- Recomposed the homepage into six editorial chapters with asymmetric vessel photography, fine rules, and an earth-toned palette.
+- Added complete studio, offerings, collection, journal, contact, privacy, and introductory handbuilding pages.
+- Rebuilt the header, mobile navigation, footer, fallback templates, and supporting documentation.
+- Replaced inquiry processing with explicitly non-submitting demo controls.
+- Added visible photographer credits, meaningful photo alternatives, reduced-motion support, and local compiled assets.
 
